Package: chromokit
Type: Package
Title: The 'chromokit' Look for 'pkgdown' Sites and 'ggplot2' Plots
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jacques", "Serizay", email = "jacquesserizay@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The R side of 'chromokit' (<https://github.com/js2264/chromokit>),
    a shared UI kit in the look of 'chromosomix': a 'pkgdown' template package
    (set 'template: package: chromokit' in '_pkgdown.yml') that gives a
    package's site the kit's palettes, light and dark, its header, code
    frames, tables and callouts; and a 'ggplot2' theme and colour scales
    from the same design tokens.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/js2264/chromokit
BugReports: https://github.com/js2264/chromokit/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Suggests:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    pkgdown (>= 2.1.0),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
